Ids":[7050702],"talks":[{"talkId":7050702,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["7050703","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7050702,"initDialog":705070201,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[10232],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Mengde_70507/Q7050702","priority":5,"questId":70507,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":705070201,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2644319594,"text":"Sorry to keep you waiting!","nextNodeIds":[705070202]},{"nodeId":705070202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1754776810,"text":"Enjoy.","nextNodeIds":[705070203]},{"nodeId":705070203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":4016513034,"text":"Mmm, the tea is clear and glows with a pleasing hue. Its richness is complemented by a floral and fruity fragrance. Exquisite.","nextNodeIds":[705070204]},{"nodeId":705070204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1257440922,"text":"Wow, so Zhongli is even super knowledgeable about tea.","nextNodeIds":[705070205]},{"nodeId":705070205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":562601770,"text":"Paimon usually just gulps down the tea and says something simple like, \"Yummy yummy in Paimon's tummy.\"","nextNodeIds":[705070206]},{"nodeId":705070206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":2424347378,"text":"Mindfully savoring the tea shows due respect to the person that brewed it for you.","nextNodeIds":[705070207]},{"nodeId":705070207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":804167698,"text":"Tea of good quality is hard to come by, and those capable of brewing tea according to the occasion and emotions even more so.","nextNodeIds":[705070208,705070209]},{"nodeId":705070208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2147890394,"text":"You're too kind.","nextNodeIds":[705070210]},{"nodeId":705070210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1080908082,"text":"Oh, Paimon gets it now.","nextNodeIds":[705070211]},{"nodeId":705070211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":877835746,"text":"So could you teach Paimon how to savor tea like you do? It seems you smell it first, then drink it, right?","nextNodeIds":[705070212]},{"nodeId":705070212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":1695648042,"text":"That's correct.","nextNodeIds":[705070213]},{"nodeId":705070213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":4233222402,"text":"Every type of tea is unique. The more you drink, the more you will understand the subtle differences. Smelling the aroma will reveal the quality of the tea.","nextNodeIds":[705070214]},{"nodeId":705070214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":1916799018,"text":"Lower-grade teas emit a musty and seemingly scorched scent, whereas ones with a delicate yet soothing aroma are usually of a higher quality.","nextNodeIds":[705070215]},{"nodeId":705070215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":3380144594,"text":"If you want to be more particular, according to Liyue ancient tradition, you could acquire a \"Vintage Goblet,\" which is used specifically for examining the aroma.","nextNodeIds":[705070216]},{"nodeId":705070216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1955737370,"text":"Oh no, all this time, Paimon's been missing out on her tea...","nextNodeIds":[705070217]},{"nodeId":705070217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":553623770,"text":"Not to worry. Knowledge is vast, it's never too late to learn.","nextNodeIds":[705070218]},{"nodeId":705070218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":4032786314,"text":"As a beginner, you can try this method: first observe the color. Then, smell the fragrance... And finally, take a sip.","nextNodeIds":[705070219]},{"nodeId":705070219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":1375882402,"text":"Remember, you can understand anything as long as you approach it in the proper order.","nextNodeIds":[705070220,705070221]},{"nodeId":705070220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1729128874,"text":"I learned a lot today.","nextNodeIds":[705070222]},{"nodeId":705070222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":527466578,"text":"Qiaoying Village in northwest Liyue is famous for their tea industry. It would be well worthwhile the visit when you get the chance.","nextNodeIds":[705070223]},{"nodeId":705070223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":1636467786,"text":"What I shared with you today are mostly my own habits as an old-fashioned Liyue local.","nextNodeIds":[705070224]},{"nodeId":705070224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":3648562530,"text":"Each region has its own tea traditions and culture. One should always respect the conventions of the local region.","nextNodeIds":[705070225]},{"nodeId":705070225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1885676122,"text":"Paimon gets it! But whether Paimon can remember it all is another story, hehe...","nextNodeIds":[705070226]},{"nodeId":705070226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2897488442,"text":"Classic Paimon.","nextNodeIds":[705070227]},{"nodeId":705070227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":2637136354,"text":"#Thank you for such excellent tea, {NICKNAME}. It made my trip out here all the more worthwhile.","nextNodeIds":[705070228]},{"nodeId":705070228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":2529381138,"text":"If you ever come to manage a tea house, I will certainly be a regular.","nextNodeIds":[705070229]},{"nodeId":705070229,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3229178994,"text":"Well, we're already pretty busy. I don't think we'll have time to manage a side hustle at a tea house.","nextNodeIds":[705070230]},{"nodeId":705070230,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3677815722,"text":"Well, who knows...","nextNodeIds":[705070231]},{"nodeId":705070231,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":1433029130,"text":"Regardless, you have my complete support.","nextNodeIds":[705070232]},{"nodeId":705070232,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":2469168258,"text":"Let's call it a day. I won't take more of your time. All the best with your new pursuit.","nextNodeIds":[705070233,705070234]},{"nodeId":705070233,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2132117306,"text":"Bye.","nextNodeIds":[705070235]},{"nodeId":705070235,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"Zhongli","textMapHash":1541962258,"text":"Ah yes, the bill... Just put it on Wangsheng Funeral Parlor's tab, as usual.","nextNodeIds":[705070236]},{"nodeId":705070236,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1588866682,"text":"Of course... Take care! Give our regards to the director!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":705070234,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2992517250,"text":"Wait, about the bill...","nextNodeIds":[705070235]},{"nodeId":705070221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":153205658,"text":"I'd like to know more.","nextNodeIds":[705070222]},{"nodeId":705070209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1497974338,"text":"I'm flattered.","nextNodeIds":[705070210]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7050702,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[106